### Common services and their SPN format + matching client tool

| Service | SPN format | Client tool |
| --- | --- | --- |
| MSSQL | `MSSQLSvc/host.domain.com:1433` | `mssqlclient.py -k` |
| SMB/file shares | `CIFS/host.domain.com` | `psexec.py -k -no-pass`, `smbclient.py -k`, `smbexec.py -k` |
| WinRM / PowerShell remoting | `HOST/host.domain.com` or `WSMAN/host.domain.com` (depends on config) | `evil-winrm -i host -r` (with ccache), or `wsmanclient` equivalents |
| LDAP (domain controller) | `LDAP/dc.domain.com` | `secretsdump.py -k` (for further DCSync, if rights allow), `ldapsearch` with Kerberos |

